<?xml version="1.0"?>
<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title
      >We&#x2019;re mapping your market &#x2013; here&#x2019;s what&#x2019;s
      next</mj-title
    >
    <mj-include path="../../../partials/attributes.mjml" />
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body background-color="#FFFFFF">
    <mj-wrapper css-class="add-asin-wrapper container" padding="0">
      <adv-header />

      <para>
        <mj-text
          >Hi <strong>{{ first_name }}, </strong></mj-text
        >
      </para>
      <para>
        <mj-text
          >Over the past few weeks, your Advantage Reports have given you a
          clear view of the competitive dynamics around
          <a href="{{ product_link }}">{{ product_title }}</a> You&#x2019;ve
          seen the pricing shifts, the listing changes, the competitors gaining
          or losing ground.</mj-text
        >
      </para>
      <para>
        <mj-text
          >But here&#x2019;s the thing &#x2013; if you sell other products on
          Amazon, each one sits in its own competitive arena. Different rivals.
          Different customer behavior. Different threats.</mj-text
        >
      </para>

      <para>
        <mj-text>
          <strong
            >Right now, those products don&#x2019;t have the same
            coverage.</strong
          >
        </mj-text>
      </para>

      <para>
        <mj-text>Remember the pain points we solved for your product?</mj-text>
      </para>

      <para>
        <mj-raw>
          <ul style="padding-left: 26px; margin: 0;"> <li>&#x201C;My sales
          dropped and I don&#x2019;t know why&#x201D;</li>
          <li>&#x201C;I&#x2019;m guessing blindly and every guess costs
          money&#x201D;</li> <li>&#x201C;I know competitors are making moves,
          but I can&#x2019;t see what&#x201D;</li> </ul>
        </mj-raw>
      </para>
      <para>
        <mj-text
          >Your other products still have these problems. A competitor could be
          undercutting your price, outranking your listing, or stealing share
          &#x2013; and you wouldn&#x2019;t know until it hit your
          revenue.</mj-text
        >
      </para>
      <para>
        <mj-text
          font-size="16px"
          font-weight="600"
          color="#344054"
          line-height="24px"
        >
          <strong>Expanding your account is simple:</strong>
        </mj-text>
      </para>
      <para>
        <mj-raw>
          <ul style="padding-left: 26px; margin: 0;"> <li><strong>Reply with the
          ASIN(s)</strong> you want to add as Hero ASINs</li> <li><strong>We
          scan then reveal the competitive landscape</strong> and start
          monitoring within 48 hours</li> <li><strong>Your weekly Advantage
          Reports</strong> expand to cover your priority products</li> </ul>
        </mj-raw>
      </para>
      <para>
        <mj-text>
          Same depth of analysis. Same weekly delivery. More of your business
          protected.
        </mj-text>
      </para>
      <para>
        <mj-text
          font-size="16px"
          font-weight="600"
          color="#344054"
          line-height="24px"
        >
          <strong>Think of it this way:</strong>
        </mj-text>
      </para>
      <para>
        <mj-text
          >One of our clients, Jason from Ultra Athlete, tracks multiple product
          lines with
          <strong
            >Am<span style="color: #088ab2; text-decoration: underline">ai</span
            >zing</strong
          >. When one competitor raises prices, he knows whether to follow
          &#x2013; across his entire catalog. That&#x2019;s the advantage of
          comprehensive coverage.</mj-text
        >
      </para>
      <para>
        <mj-text
          font-size="16px"
          font-weight="600"
          color="#344054"
          line-height="24px"
        >
          <strong>Ready to extend your coverage?</strong>
        </mj-text>
      </para>
      <para>
        <mj-text
          >Just reply with your Hero ASINs and we&#x2019;ll take it from there.
          Questions about pricing for additional products? We&#x2019;re happy to
          walk you through it.</mj-text
        >
      </para>
      <para>
        <mj-text
          >Some brands watch just one product. The best watch their entire
          portfolio.
          <strong
            >Be Am<span style="color: #088ab2; text-decoration: underline"
              >ai</span
            >zing.</strong
          ></mj-text
        >
      </para>
      <para classes="greeting-text">
        <mj-text>Thanks</mj-text>
      </para>
      <para padding-bottom="0">
        <mj-text
          >The
          <strong
            >Am<span style="color: #088ab2; text-decoration: underline">ai</span
            >zing</strong
          >
          Team</mj-text
        >
      </para>
      <adv-footer />
    </mj-wrapper>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
